mark draft

# shelved 2026-10-03: a sketch of a database connection, with no loads and types the language does not have (`string`,
# `int`, `result-set`). An unknown type name is refused now (check/type-names.ts), so it stays out of the build until
# it is written against @term/base. Nothing loads it.

form connection
  task close, like void
  task commit, like void
  task db-name, like string
  task escapes, like string
  task last-insert-id, like int
  task quotes, like string
  task requests, like result-set
  task rollback, like void
  task start-transaction, like void
